window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An ex-cop who cannot die. A moon full of settlers who cannot thrive. Mahina's terraformers built a high-tech urban paradise. Then Earth flooded the colony with desperate refugees, cop Sass Collier among them.</p> <p>The settlers who arrived with Sass died decades ago. Outside the citadel, their descendants die weak and young.</p> <p>Sass fought a rebellion against the city once. She won concessions to give the settlers a chance at health. She paid with 20 years in prison.</p> <p>Now she’s out, a reformed character. She assembles an oddball crew doing odd jobs. She intends to mind her own business–how to make a profit on the skyship Thrive.</p> <p>But her fellow settlers are still failing.</p> <p>While her business model careens toward circus acts, Sass dares to defy the city again, to solve Mahina’s failure to thrive.</p> <p>Download <i>Thrive Space Colony Adventures </i>because you love upbeat character-driven SF with fun technology. Suggested for fans of <i>Firefly</i>, Lindsay Buroker's Star Kingdom, or Nathan Lowell’s Golden Age of the Solar Clipper books.</p> <p>This Publisher's Pack includes:</p> <ul> <li>Skyship Thrive: Sass recruits a crew and defies authorities on Mahina.</li> <li>Spaceship Thrive: the crew gets their space legs visiting a neighboring moon.</li> </ul>"; 
